# Tutorial: Getting Started with cargo-cicd

<!-- BEGIN custom:audience -->
**Audience:** Rust developers new to cargo-cicd who want a guided walkthrough.
<!-- END custom:audience -->

<!-- BEGIN custom:prerequisites -->
## Prerequisites

- Rust toolchain installed (`rustup`)
- A Rust workspace with a `Cargo.toml` at the root
- `cargo-cicd` installed: `cargo install cargo-cicd`
<!-- END custom:prerequisites -->

<!-- BEGIN ggen:initial-commands -->
<!-- Rendered from ontology. Do not edit. -->
## Available Commands

The following commands are available in this workspace:

| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
{% for row in rows -%}
| `cargo cicd {{ row.noun_name }} {{ row.verb_name }}` | {{ row.verb_about }} |
