<!-- BEGIN custom:step-by-step -->
## Step-by-Step

### Step 1: Verify your workspace

Confirm `cargo-cicd` can see your workspace:

```sh
cargo cicd workspace check
```

### Step 2: Run your first command

Pick a command from the table above and run it in your workspace root.

### Step 3: Inspect cicd.toml

After running a command, `cargo-cicd` publishes state to `cicd.toml`:

```sh
cat cicd.toml
```
<!-- END custom:step-by-step -->

